{"title":"Warden Lord","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 65 Rime Elemental that attacks with freeze (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">crush</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">burn</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 15% damage (the game's own rule). Monsters have no resistances.</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 1 looted corpse recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\" title=\"Gold Coin - 1 recorded drop, 56 total, 56 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d30bb3ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Coin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×56</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"rime-crystal\" title=\"Rime Crystal - in 1 of 1 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/582c41ee5ac2654c6a77.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Rime Crystal</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×1</span></div></div></div><div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses whose loot was recorded; kills nobody looted are not counted), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><p class=\"muted\">No sightings yet.</p>\n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Rime Elemental: <a href=\"#/monster/rime-shard\">Rime Shard</a> <span class=\"muted\">(61)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/rime-elemental\">Rime Elemental</a> <span class=\"muted\">(63)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/glacier-warden\">Glacier Warden</a> <span cla